<title>FRANCE: Gle des Eaux nine month sales stable.</title>
<headline>Gle des Eaux nine month sales stable.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in billions of French francs)</p>
<p>Turnover					117.4</p>
<p>NOTE - The company gave the figures in a statement. It said 1996 nine month sales were stable compared to the same period a year ago but gave no year ago figures. It said that on a like-for-like basis the sales rose 1.1 percent.</p>
<p>It said sales in its communications sector were up 73.2 percent in the period.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
